<p>The separate original 12 MP photo uses {largeIndependentReduction}% fewer bytes at the same nominal encoder setting. Butteraugli changes from {largeIndependent.result.baselineRaw.butteraugli.toFixed(4)} to {largeIndependent.result.butteraugli.toFixed(4)}, and SSIMULACRA2 from {largeIndependent.result.baselineRaw.ssimulacra2.toFixed(4)} to {largeIndependent.result.ssimulacra2.toFixed(4)}. Its full public/native grid passes. This is one same-setting control; a matched independent-photo curve remains pending. The large-gradient control retains its existing quality and memory limits after independent native/Rust qualification. <a href="/jpeg-xl/evidence/large-transform-independent-point.json" download>Independent public photo point</a> and <a href="/jpeg-xl/evidence/large-transform-gradient-control.json" download>Large-gradient validation</a>.</p>
